LangString POME_WELCOME_TITLE 1033 "Install Pome Panel"
LangString POME_WELCOME_TITLE 2052 "安装 Pome Panel"
LangString POME_WELCOME_TEXT 1033 "This wizard will install Pome Panel.$\r$\n$\r$\nChoose an installation folder on the next page. Shortcuts will be created on the desktop and in the Start menu."
LangString POME_WELCOME_TEXT 2052 "此向导将安装 Pome Panel。$\r$\n$\r$\n下一步可以选择程序的安装目录。安装完成后，将在桌面和开始菜单创建启动快捷方式。"
LangString POME_DIRECTORY_TEXT 1033 "Choose where to install Pome Panel. Program files will be stored there; a shortcut will be created on your desktop."
LangString POME_DIRECTORY_TEXT 2052 "请选择 Pome Panel 的安装目录。程序文件保存在此目录，桌面将创建启动快捷方式。"
